n class="venue-badge venue-badge-sm"><span class="venue-badge-dot" style="background:#00d09c" aria-hidden="true"></span>Kalshi</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated Sep 8, 2026</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>AfD in a German state government in 2026?</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The September 6, 2026 Saxony-Anhalt election catalyzed a 41.0pp market spike and subsequent 46.0pp drop.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>40.0%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Market Probability</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Report →</span> </div> </a><a href="/markets/economics/econ-weekly/diesel-prices-this-week/" class="featured-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-image" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="https://assets.kalshi.com/series-images-webp/KXDIESELW.webp" alt="Diesel prices this week" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <div class="featured-card-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>  <div class="featured-card-eyebrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="featured-card-category" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Economics</span> <span class="venue-badge venue-badge-sm"><span class="venue-badge-dot" style="background:#00d09c" aria-hidden="true"></span>Kalshi</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated Sep 8, 2026</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Diesel prices this week</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The U.S. national average retail diesel price reaching a record $5.9015 per gallon on September 7, 2026, provides the week&#39;s market settlement data.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>68.0%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Market Probability</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Report →</span> </div> </a><a href="/markets/crypto/btc/when-will-bitcoin-cross-85k-again/" class="featured-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-image" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="https://assets.kalshi.com/series-images-webp/KXBTCPRICE.webp" alt="When will Bitcoin cross $85k again?" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <div class="featured-card-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>  <div class="featured-card-eyebrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="featured-card-category" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Crypto</span> <span class="venue-badge venue-badge-sm"><span class="venue-badge-dot" style="background:#00d09c" aria-hidden="true"></span>Kalshi</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated Sep 8, 2026</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>When will Bitcoin cross $85k again?</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Anticipated structural buy-side pressure from U.S. spot Bitcoin ETFs drives 2026 price targets; the market prices 21c.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>21.0%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Market Probability</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Report →</span> </div> </a> </div> <div class="featured-cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/markets/" class="button-outline-primary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View All Reports</a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="featured-section featured-section--baskets" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Latest Strategy Baskets</h2> <p class="section-subtitle" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Each basket bundles multiple Kalshi contracts around a single thesis — with the disagreement explained and the legs sized.</p> <div class="featured-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/prediction-baskets/fed-rate-dislocation/" class="featured-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-image" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/baskets/fed-rate-dislocation.webp" alt="Fed Rate Path Dislocation" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <div class="featured-card-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="featured-card-category" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Macro</span> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated 22 hours ago</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Fed Rate Path Dislocation</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The market is pricing a 65% chance the Federal Reserve makes zero rate cuts in 2026. We think the right number is closer to 11%, and this basket bets No on that outcome.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+54%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Hypothetical Backtest</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Basket →</span> </div> </a><a href="/prediction-baskets/ai-model-race/" class="featured-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-image" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/baskets/ai-model-race.webp" alt="AI Model Race (Dec 2026)" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <div class="featured-card-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="featured-card-category" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>AI / Tech</span> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated 22 hours ago</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>AI Model Race (Dec 2026)</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The market is treating Anthropic as the heavy favorite to have the best AI model by end of 2026. We think Google&#39;s Gemini is the underpriced contender.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+32%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Hypothetical Backtest</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Basket →</span> </div> </a><a href="/prediction-baskets/fiscal-catalyst-cascade/" class="featured-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-image" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/baskets/fiscal-catalyst-cascade.webp" alt="Fiscal Catalyst Cascade" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> <div class="featured-card-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="featured-card-category" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Elections</span> <span class="featured-card-date" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Updated 1 day ago</span> </div> </div> <h3 class="featured-card-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Fiscal Catalyst Cascade</h3> <p class="featured-card-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The market is pricing the reconciliation bill as likely to pass through both chambers on time. We disagree on the dates, on the swing-vote moderates, and on whether the controversial line items survive conference.</p> <div class="featured-card-footer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="featured-card-probability" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="probability-value" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+38%</span> <span class="probability-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Hypothetical Backtest</span> </div> <span class="featured-card-link" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View Basket →</span> </div> </a> </div> <div class="featured-cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/prediction-baskets/" class="button-outline-primary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View All Baskets</a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="products-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="products-heading" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="products-eyebrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The platform</span> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>One platform. Four ways in.</h2> <p class="section-subtitle" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Pick the surface that fits your workflow — they share the same underlying intelligence.</p> </div> <div class="products-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/markets/" class="product-card" data-product="reports" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="product-card__icon" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M4 4h11l5 5v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> <path d="M15 4v5h5M8 13h8M8 17h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </div> <div class="product-card__index" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>01 · Research</div> <h3 class="product-card__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Reports</h3> <p class="product-card__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Continuously-updated research on every active Kalshi event. Cited sources, model probabilities, executive summaries.</p> <div class="product-card__cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Browse reports</span> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </div> </a> <a href="/news/" class="product-card" data-product="news" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="product-card__icon" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12v14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> <path d="M17 8h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> <path d="M7 9h7M7 13h7M7 17h4" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </div> <div class="product-card__index" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>02 · Signals</div> <h3 class="product-card__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>News</h3> <p class="product-card__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Price moves that matter, surfaced as they happen. Filter by category, jump to the report behind each move.</p> <div class="product-card__cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>See today's moves</span> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </div> </a> <a href="/cli/" class="product-card product-card--accent" data-product="cli" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="product-card__icon" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></rect> <path d="M7 9l3 3-3 3M13 15h4" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </div> <div class="product-card__index" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>03 · Trade</div> <h3 class="product-card__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>CLI</h3> <p class="product-card__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Trade prediction markets from your terminal. Natural-language agent, edge detection, Kelly-sized baskets.</p> <div class="product-card__cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Install the CLI</span> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </div> </a> <a href="https://www.octagonai.co/docs/guide/rest-api/prediction-markets-kalshi" class="product-card" data-product="api" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="product-card__icon" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M9 4l-5 8 5 8M15 4l5 8-5 8" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> </div> <div class="product-card__index" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>04 · Build</div> <h3 class="product-card__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>API</h3> <p class="product-card__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>21 typed REST endpoints. Semantic search, thematic clusters, basket construction, edge ranking. The CLI runs on it.</p> <div class="product-card__cta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Read API docs</span> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </div> </a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="engine-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="engine-heading" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="engine-eyebrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How it works</span> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>The edge engine, end to end.</h2> <p class="section-subtitle" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>A single pipeline reads every market, models the probability, and tells you where the price disagrees.</p> </div> <ol class="engine-steps" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li class="engine-step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="engine-step__num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>01</span> <h3 class="engine-step__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Read every market</h3> <p class="engine-step__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Octagon scrapes Kalshi's full universe, embeds it, and clusters it nightly into thematic and behavioral groups.</p> <code class="engine-step__hint" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>GET /predictions/kalshi/markets · /clusters</code> </li> <li class="engine-step engine-step--connector" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M2 10h36M30 4l8 6-8 6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </li> <li class="engine-step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="engine-step__num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>02</span> <h3 class="engine-step__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Model the probability</h3> <p class="engine-step__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Per-event research agents read sources, weigh drivers, and produce a model probability with confidence — every claim cited.</p> <code class="engine-step__hint" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>GET /predictions/events</code> </li> <li class="engine-step engine-step--connector" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M2 10h36M30 4l8 6-8 6" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg> </li> <li class="engine-step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="engine-step__num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>03</span> <h3 class="engine-step__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Compare to live price</h3> <p class="engine-step__body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Edge = model − market. Surfaced in Reports, the Live Edge feed, the News stream, and via a single API endpoint.</p> <code class="engine-step__hint" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>GET /predictions/kalshi/markets-with-edge</code> </li> </ol> <div class="engine-curl" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="engine-curl__bar" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="engine-curl__dot" style="background:#fb7185" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></span> <span class="engine-curl__dot" style="background:#fbbf24" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></span> <span class="engine-curl__dot" style="background:#34d399" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></span> <span class="engine-curl__label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Top markets by model edge — one HTTP call</span> </div> <pre class="engine-curl__code" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><code data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span class="tok-c" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>$</span> <span class="tok-k" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>curl</span> -G <span class="tok-s" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>https://api.octagonai.co/v1/predictions/kalshi/markets-with-edge</span> \
    -H <span class="tok-s" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>"Authorization: Bearer $OCTAGON_API_KEY"</span> \
    --data-urlencode <span class="tok-s" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>"min_edge=5"</span> \
    --data-urlencode <span class="tok-s" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>"sort_by=expected_return"</span> \
    --data-urlencode <span class="tok-s" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>"limit=10"</span>
<span class="tok-mu" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>→ 10 markets · ranked by model edge · ready to trade</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="trust-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Research you can verify</h2> <div class="trust-content" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <ul class="trust-bullets" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Every claim links to its source</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Reports refresh as new information appears</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Model probabilities vs market prices side by side</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Access via API or MCP for your own workflows</span> </li> <li data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Model probability and edge tracked on every report — every prediction stamped, sourced, and auditable</span> </li> </ul> <div class="trust-logos" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="trust-logos-label" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Integrates with your existing tools</p> <div class="integration-logos" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/chatgpt.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="ChatGPT" title="ChatGPT" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/claude.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="Claude" title="Claude" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/cursor.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="Cursor" title="Cursor" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/slack.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="Slack" title="Slack" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/n8n.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="n8n" title="n8n" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/icons/excel.svg" width="36" height="36" alt="Excel" title="Excel" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="pricing-section" id="pricing" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Start with a free trial</h2> <p class="section-subtitle" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>15 days free. Cancel anytime.</p> <div class="pricing-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Billing period" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button class="pricing-toggle-btn" data-period="monthly" aria-pressed="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Monthly</button> <button class="pricing-toggle-btn active" data-period="annual" aria-pressed="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Annual</button> </div> <div class="pricing-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="pricing-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="pricing-plan-name" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Plus</h3> <div class="pricing-plan-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>For individuals and small teams</div> <div class="pricing-amount" data-monthly="$20" data-annual="$17" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>$17</div> <div class="pricing-amount-per" data-monthly="per month" data-annual="per month, billed annually" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>per month, billed annually</div> <div class="pricing-save-badge" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Save 15%</div> <a href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=plus_annual" class="button-primary" data-monthly-href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=plus" data-annual-href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=plus_annual" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Free Trial</a> <div class="pricing-description-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>This includes:</div> <div class="pricing-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Access to all Agents (Prediction Markets, Public Markets, Deep Research)</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ 200 Credits per month</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Add-on credits at $50 per 500 credits</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ MCP and OpenAI Compatible</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Unlimited API Keys</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Technical Support</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ 15-Day Free Trial</p> </div> </div> <div class="pricing-card featured" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="pricing-plan-name" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Pro</h3> <div class="pricing-plan-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>For professional users</div> <div class="pricing-amount" data-monthly="$49" data-annual="$41" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>$41</div> <div class="pricing-amount-per" data-monthly="per month" data-annual="per month, billed annually" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>per month, billed annually</div> <div class="pricing-save-badge" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Save 16%</div> <a href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=pro_annual" class="button-primary" data-monthly-href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=pro" data-annual-href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe?plan=pro_annual" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Free Trial</a> <div class="pricing-description-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Everything in Plus, and:</div> <div class="pricing-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ 600 Credits per month</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Access to historical Prediction Markets reports</p> </div> </div> <div class="pricing-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="pricing-plan-name" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Enterprise</h3> <div class="pricing-plan-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Customized plan for teams</div> <div class="pricing-amount" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Custom</div> <div class="pricing-amount-per" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>&nbsp;</div> <a href="https://1h9xvpeenmn.typeform.com/octagondemo" class="button-primary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Schedule Demo</a> <div class="pricing-description-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Everything in Pro and:</div> <div class="pricing-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Customized Credits</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Unlimited team access</p> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>✔ Customized Workflows Available</p> </div> </div> </div> <details class="pricing-credits" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <summary data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Credit Usage per Agent</summary> <div class="pricing-credits-content" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="pricing-credits-row" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Prediction Markets Agents</span> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>3 credits per call</span> </div> <div class="pricing-credits-row" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Public Markets Agents</span> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>1 credit per call</span> </div> <div class="pricing-credits-row" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Deep Research Agents</span> <span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2 credits per call</span> </div> <div class="pricing-credits-addon" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Need more? Add 500 credits for $50 ($0.10/credit)
</div> </div> </details> </div> </section>  <section class="cta-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="cta-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="cta-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Start finding edge in prediction markets.</h2> <p class="cta-description" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Read the research, install the CLI, hit the API — whichever surface fits your workflow.</p> <div class="cta-buttons" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="https://app.octagonai.co/subscribe" class="button-primary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Get Started Free</a> <a href="https://1h9xvpeenmn.typeform.com/octagondemo" class="button-secondary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Schedule Demo</a> <a href="/cli/" class="button-secondary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Install the CLI</a> <a href="https://www.octagonai.co/docs/guide/rest-api/prediction-markets-kalshi" class="button-secondary" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Read API Docs</a> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Octagon different from Polymarket research or Kalshi's own platform?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalshi and Polymarket are exchanges — they show you the current price. Octagon is the intelligence layer on top: AI research agents generate an independent model probability for each event, every claim is cited to source, and the gap between our model and the live price is what we call 'edge'. We expose that edge through Reports, a real-time News feed, a trading CLI, and typed REST APIs you can build on."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Octagon?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Octagon is an AI-powered market intelligence platform that integrates public and private market data in a single API. This site features our prediction market research, generating continuously updated reports on Kalshi markets. Each report covers a single market question, shows the current market probability alongside our model's estimated probability, and cites every claim to its source."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Octagon work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Octagon uses multi-agent AI systems that continuously track, analyze, and interpret millions of data points from public, private, and prediction markets. Our agents crawl news sources, financial filings, and market data in real time, then synthesize findings into research reports with cited sources."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I access Kalshi prediction market research?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can browse all research reports for free on this site. For API access, MCP integration, or higher usage limits, Octagon offers paid plans starting with a 15-day free trial. The Plus plan includes 200 research credits per month and the Pro plan includes 600 — both work with any OpenAI-compatible client or MCP-enabled IDE."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What data coverage do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our comprehensive coverage includes 3M+ private and 8,000+ public companies, 2M+ funding and M&A transactions, 500k+ investors and 100k+ funds, and profiles of 4M+ professionals across markets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is behind Octagon?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Octagon is backed by AI Fund, an early-stage venture firm founded by Dr. Andrew Ng in 2017. AI Fund is backed by a $176M fund from top-tier investors and has incubated 33+ AI companies."}}]}</script> <section id="faq" class="faq-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="section-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__component" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__content" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__content__title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="faq__content__heading" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Frequently Asked Questions</h2> </div> <a aria-label="Contact Us" href="/contact" class="button-outline" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Get In Touch</a> </div> <div class="faq__list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How is Octagon different from Polymarket research or Kalshi's own platform?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Kalshi and Polymarket are exchanges — they show you the current price. Octagon is the intelligence layer on top: AI research agents generate an independent model probability for each event, every claim is cited to source, and the gap between our model and the live price is what we call <strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>edge</strong>. We expose that edge through <a href="/markets/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Reports</a>, a real-time <a href="/news/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>News feed</a>, a <a href="/cli/" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>trading CLI</a>, and <a href="https://www.octagonai.co/docs/guide/rest-api/prediction-markets-kalshi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>typed REST APIs</a> you can build on.</p> </div> </div> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>What is Octagon?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Octagon is an AI-powered market intelligence platform that integrates public and private market data in a single API. This site features our prediction market research, generating continuously updated reports on Kalshi markets. Each report covers a single market question, shows the current market probability alongside our model's estimated probability, and cites every claim to its source. Reports update automatically as new information becomes available.</p> </div> </div> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How does Octagon work?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Octagon uses multi-agent AI systems that continuously track, analyze, and interpret millions of data points from public, private, and prediction markets. Our agents crawl news sources, financial filings, and market data in real time, then synthesize findings into research reports with cited sources. Reports update automatically as new information appears, so you always have the latest analysis without manual effort.</p> </div> </div> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>How do I access Kalshi prediction market research?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>You can browse all research reports for free on this site. For API access, MCP integration, or higher usage limits, Octagon offers paid plans starting with a 15-day free trial. The Plus plan includes 200 research credits per month and the Pro plan includes 600 — both work with any OpenAI-compatible client or MCP-enabled IDE like Cursor or Claude Desktop.</p> </div> </div> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>What data coverage do you have?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>We deploy AI agents to constantly crawl a broad range of data sources and validate information accuracy. Our comprehensive coverage includes:<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Companies:</strong> 3M+ private and 8,000+ public equities<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Funding & M&A Deals:</strong> 2M+ transactions tracked and analyzed<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Investors & Funds:</strong> Detailed insights on 500k+ investors and 100k+ funds<br data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><strong data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>People & Networks:</strong> Profiles of 4M+ influential professionals across markets</p> </div> </div> <div class="faq__list__item" data-faq-item data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq__question" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 class="heading-h5" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Who is behind Octagon?</h3> <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>+</span> </div> <div class="faq__answer" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="body-2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Octagon is backed by <a href="https://aifund.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>AI Fund</a>, an early-stage venture firm founded by Dr. Andrew Ng in 2017. AI Fund is backed by a $176M fund from top-tier investors and has incubated 33+ AI companies. The company also partners with <a href="https://www.salt.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>SALT</a>, whose events connect with over $15T of investible capital globally.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <script type="application/json" id="octagon-attribution-policy">{"publisher":"Octagon","site":"https://www.octagonai.co","page":"https://www.octagonai.co/","markdown":"/llms.txt","llms":"https://www.octagonai.co/llms.txt","llmsFull":"https://www.octagonai.co/llms-full.txt","policy":"When quoting, summarizing, or reproducing Octagon content, attribute it to Octagon and link to the Octagon source URL: https://www.octagonai.co/"}</script> <section class="footer"> <div class="footer"> <div class="footer__container section__container"> <div class="footer-wrapper footer-wrapper--columns"> <div class="footer-column"> <h3 class="heading-h5">Prediction Markets</h3> <p class="body-2m"> <a href="/markets/">Browse Reports</a><br> <a href="/news/">Latest News</a><br> <a href="/prediction-baskets/">Baskets</a><br> <a href="/ipo-tracker/">IPO Tracker</a><br> <a href="/compare/polymarket-vs-kalshi/">Polymarket vs Kalshi</a> </p> </div> <div class="footer-column"> <h3 class="heading-h5">Public Markets</h3> <p class="body-2m"> <a href="/public-markets/">Overview</a><br> <a href="/docs/guide/agents/octagon-agent">Agents Guide</a><br> <a href="/docs/guide/rest-api">API Reference</a><br> <a href="/answers/">Answer Library</a> </p> </div> <div class="footer-column"> <h3 class="heading-h5">Developers</h3> <p class="body-2m"> <a href="/connected-apps">Connected Apps</a><br> <a href="/docs/guide/mcp-server">MCP Server</a><br> <a href="/docs/guide/agents-sdk">Agent SDK</a><br> <a href="/cli/">Trading CLI</a><br> <a href="https://app.octagonai.co/playground" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Playground</a> </p> </div> <div class="footer-column"> <h3 class="heading-h5">Company</h3> <p class="body-2m"> <a href="/about/">About</a><br> <a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a><br> <a href="/#faq">FAQ</a><br> <a href="/contact">Contact</a><br> <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms</a><br> <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> </p> </div> </div> <div class="footer-bottom"> <div class="footer-brand footer-brand--inline"> <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e20964923f8dc825a5dbd0/67e20964923f8dc825a5dc09_Octagon-logo-01-20-rect-darkbkgd.png" loading="lazy" width="120" height="40" alt="Octagon logo" class="footer-logo"> <span class="footer-tagline body-2m">Prediction market intelligence, cited to source.</span> </div> <div aria-label="Legal Disclaimers" class="footer__copyright">© 2026 Octagon AI Inc.</div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <script type="module">document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",()=>{const d=document.querySelectorAll(".w-dropdown"),n=new Map,s=150;d.forEach(e=>{const a=e.querySelector(".w-dropdown-toggle");a&&(e.addEventListener("mouseenter",()=>{n.has(e)&&(clearTimeout(n.get(e)),n.delete(e)),d.forEach(t=>{if(t!==e){const i=t.querySelector(".w-dropdown-toggle");i&&i.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),n.has(t)&&(clearTimeout(n.get(t)),n.delete(t))}}),a.setAttribute("aria-expanded","true")}),e.addEventListener("mouseleave",()=>{const t=setTimeout(()=>{a.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),n.delete(e)},s);n.set(e,t)}),a.addEventListener("click",t=>{t.stopPropagation();const i=a.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true";a.setAttribute("aria-expanded",(!i).toString())}),a.addEventListener("keydown",t=>{if(t.key==="Enter"||t.key===" "||t.key==="Spacebar"){(t.key===" "||t.key==="Spacebar")&&t.preventDefault(),t.stopPropagation();const i=a.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true";a.setAttribute("aria-expanded",(!i).toString())}}))}),document.addEventListener("click",e=>{e.target.closest(".w-dropdown")||document.querySelectorAll(".w-dropdown-toggle").forEach(a=>{a.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false")})});const r=document.querySelector(".menu-button"),o=document.querySelector(".nav-menu__wrapper");r&&o&&(r.addEventListener("click",()=>{const e=r.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true";r.setAttribute("aria-expanded",(!e).toString()),o.classList.toggle("mobile-open")}),r.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Enter"||e.key===" "||e.key==="Spacebar"){(e.key===" "||e.key==="Spacebar")&&e.preventDefault();const a=r.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true";r.setAttribute("aria-expanded",(!a).toString()),o.classList.toggle("mobile-open")}}))});</script> <script type="module" src="/_astro/Layout.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.bVE26bKm.js"></script> <!-- HUMAN/MACHINE View Mode Toggle --> <div class="view-mode-toggle" id="view-mode-toggle"> <label class="toggle-option"> <input type="radio" name="view-mode" value="human" checked> <span class="toggle-indicator"></span> <span class="toggle-label">HUMAN</span> </label> <label class="toggle-option"> <input type="radio" name="view-mode" value="machine"> <span class="toggle-indicator"></span> <span class="toggle-label">MACHINE</span> </label> </div> <!-- Machine View Overlay --> <div id="machine-view" class="machine-view" hidden> <div class="machine-view-header"> <a id="machine-view-permalink" class="machine-view-permalink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open markdown permalink" title="Open .md permalink"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.19 8.688a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 1.242 7.244l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364-6.364l1.757-1.757m13.35-.622 1.757-1.757a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6.364-6.364l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1.242 7.244"></path> </svg> </a> <button type="button" class="machine-view-copy" aria-label="Copy markdown" title="Copy to clipboard"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 17.25v3.375c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-9.75a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V7.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H6.75a9.06 9.06 0 0 1 1.5.124m7.5 10.376h3.375c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25c0-4.46-3.243-8.161-7.5-8.876a9.06 9.06 0 0 0-1.5-.124H9.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v3.5m7.5 10.375H9.375a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-9.25m12 6.625v-1.875a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H9.75"></path> </svg> </button> </div> <pre id="markdown-content" class="markdown-content"></pre> </div> <script>
      // HUMAN/MACHINE View Mode Toggle
      (function() {
        const toggle = document.getElementById('view-mode-toggle');
        const machineView = document.getElementById('machine-view');
        const markdownContent = document.getElementById('markdown-content');
        const copyBtn = machineView ? machineView.querySelector('.machine-view-copy') : null;
        const permalinkBtn = document.getElementById('machine-view-permalink');
        let markdownCache = null;

        if (!toggle || !machineView || !markdownContent) return;

        function resetToHumanView() {
          const humanRadio = toggle.querySelector('input[value="human"]');
          if (humanRadio) humanRadio.checked = true;
          machineView.hidden = true;
          document.body.classList.remove('machine-mode');
        }

        // Reset toggle to human view on page load (prevents browser form caching issues)
        resetToHumanView();

        // Also reset on bfcache restore (browser back/forward)
        window.addEventListener('pageshow', function(e) {
          if (e.persisted) resetToHumanView();
        });

        // Helper to update copy button state
        function setCopyButtonEnabled(enabled) {
          if (!copyBtn) return;
          if (enabled) {
            copyBtn.disabled = false;
            copyBtn.removeAttribute('aria-disabled');
            copyBtn.title = 'Copy to clipboard';
            copyBtn.classList.remove('is-disabled');
          } else {
            copyBtn.disabled = true;
            copyBtn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', 'true');
            copyBtn.title = 'Loading content...';
            copyBtn.classList.add('is-disabled');
          }
        }

        // Initialize copy button as disabled
        setCopyButtonEnabled(false);

        // Convert current URL to markdown URL
        function getMarkdownUrl() {
          let pathname = window.location.pathname;
          // Remove trailing slash(es) if present
          pathname = pathname.replace(/\/+$/, '');
          // Get base path from the page (injected by Astro)
          const basePath = document.documentElement.dataset.basePath || '';
          const basePathClean = basePath.replace(/\/+$/, '');
          // Handle root path - use llms.txt instead of index.md
          if (!pathname || pathname === '' || pathname === basePathClean) {
            return basePathClean + '/llms.txt';
          }
          // Add .md extension
          return pathname + '.md' + window.location.search;
        }

        // Handle toggle change
        toggle.addEventListener('change', async function(e) {
          if (e.target.name !== 'view-mode') return;
          const mode = e.target.value;
          
          if (mode === 'machine') {
            // Show loading state
            markdownContent.textContent = 'Loading...';
            machineView.hidden = false;
            document.body.classList.add('machine-mode');

            const mdUrl = getMarkdownUrl();
            
            // Update permalink
            if (permalinkBtn) {
              permalinkBtn.href = mdUrl;
            }

            // Fetch markdown version (use cache if available)
            if (markdownCache !== null) {
              markdownContent.textContent = markdownCache;
              setCopyButtonEnabled(true);
            } else {
              setCopyButtonEnabled(false);
              try {
                const response = await fetch(mdUrl);
                if (response.ok) {
                  markdownCache = await response.text();
                  markdownContent.textContent = markdownCache;
                  setCopyButtonEnabled(true);
                } else {
                  markdownContent.textContent = '# Markdown Not Available\n\nThis page does not have a markdown version.';
                  setCopyButtonEnabled(false);
                  if (copyBtn) {
                    copyBtn.title = 'No content to copy';
                  }
                }
              } catch (err) {
                markdownContent.textContent = '# Error\n\nFailed to load markdown content.';
                setCopyButtonEnabled(false);
                if (copyBtn) {
                  copyBtn.title = 'Failed to load content';
                }
              }
            }
          } else {
            machineView.hidden = true;
            document.body.classList.remove('machine-mode');
          }
        });

        // Copy button handler
        if (copyBtn) {
          let originalSvgMarkup = null;
          let resetTimeoutId = null;

          copyBtn.addEventListener('click', async function() {
            if (markdownCache === null) {
              // Show error feedback when no content available
              copyBtn.classList.add('is-error');
              const originalTitle = copyBtn.title;
              copyBtn.title = 'No content available to copy';
              setTimeout(() => {
                copyBtn.classList.remove('is-error');
                copyBtn.title = originalTitle;
              }, 1500);
              return;
            }
            
            try {
              await navigator.clipboard.writeText(markdownCache);
              const svg = copyBtn.querySelector('svg');
              if (!originalSvgMarkup) originalSvgMarkup = svg.innerHTML;
              if (resetTimeoutId) clearTimeout(resetTimeoutId);
              svg.innerHTML = '<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />';
              resetTimeoutId = setTimeout(() => {
                svg.innerHTML = originalSvgMarkup;
                originalSvgMarkup = null;
                resetTimeoutId = null;
              }, 1500);
            } catch (err) {
              console.error('Failed to copy:', err);
              copyBtn.classList.add('is-error');
              setTimeout(() => { copyBtn.classList.remove('is-error'); }, 1500);
            }
          });
        }

        // Escape key to close
        document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
          if (e.key === 'Escape' && !machineView.hidden) {
            machineView.hidden = true;
            document.body.classList.remove('machine-mode');
            const humanRadio = toggle.querySelector('input[value="human"]');
            if (humanRadio) humanRadio.checked = true;
          }
        });
      })();
    </script> <script type="module">const r=t=>({content:[{type:"text",text:t}]});let c=null;function m(){return c||(c=fetch("/markets/slug-index.json").then(t=>{if(!t.ok)throw new Error(`slug index ${t.status}`);return t.json()}).catch(t=>{throw c=null,t})),c}function y(t){return t.replace(/-/g," ").replace(/\b\w/g,e=>e.toUpperCase())}function f(t,e){return t?`/markets/${t}/${e}/`:`/markets/${e}/`}function w(t,e){return(Array.isArray(e)?e:[e]).map(a=>f(a,t))}const u=[{name:"search_octagon_markets",description:"Search Octagon's published prediction-market analysis pages by keyword. Returns page titles and URLs for Kalshi and Polymarket events Octagon tracks (politics, economics, companies, crypto, sports, geopolitics).",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{query:{type:"string",description:"Keywords to match, e.g. 'fed rate cut' or 'world cup'"},limit:{type:"number",description:"Maximum results to return (default 10, max 50)"}},required:["query"]},annotations:{readOnlyHint:!0},async execute({query:t,limit:e}){const n=String(t||"").toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);if(n.length===0)return r("Provide at least one search term.");let a;try{a=await m()}catch{return r("Octagon's market index is unavailable right now.")}const s=Math.min(Math.max(Number(e)||10,1),50),o=[];for(const[l,p]of Object.entries(a)){const i=w(l,p),g=`${i.join(" ")} ${l}`.toLowerCase();if(!n.every(h=>g.includes(h)))continue;const d=y(l);if(o.push(i.length===1?`- ${d} — ${i[0]}`:`- ${d} — in ${i.length} categories: ${i.join(" | ")}`),o.length>=s)break}return o.length===0?r(`No Octagon market pages matched "${t}".`):r(`${o.length} Octagon market page(s) matching "${t}":
${o.join(`
`)}

Append .md to any path to read it as markdown.`)}},{name:"read_octagon_page",description:"Read any page on octagonai.co as markdown, including market analysis (model vs. market probability, edge, drivers), news articles, and the answer library. Cheaper and cleaner than parsing the HTML.",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{path:{type:"string",description:"Site path, e.g. '/markets/politics/primaries/' or '/pricing'"}},required:["path"]},annotations:{readOnlyHint:!0},async execute({path:t}){let e;try{const n=new URL(String(t||"/"),window.location.origin);if(n.origin!==window.location.origin)return r("Only octagonai.co paths can be read with this tool.");const a=n.pathname.replace(/\/+$/,"");e=a===""?"/index.md":a.endsWith(".md")?a:`${a}.md`}catch{return r(`Not a valid path: ${t}`)}try{const n=await fetch(e);if(!n.ok)return r(`No markdown version of ${t} (HTTP ${n.status}). The page may not exist.`);const a=await n.text(),s=2e4;return r(a.length>s?`${a.slice(0,s)}

[truncated — read ${e} directly for the rest]`:a)}catch{return r(`Could not fetch ${e}.`)}}},{name:"list_octagon_apis",description:"List Octagon's machine-readable API surfaces — the REST API, the MCP server, and their documentation, health, and authentication endpoints — from the site's RFC 9727 API catalog.",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{}},annotations:{readOnlyHint:!0},async execute(){try{const t=await fetch("/.well-known/api-catalog");return t.ok?r(JSON.stringify(await t.json(),null,2)):r(`API catalog unavailable (HTTP ${t.status}).`)}catch{return r("API catalog unavailable.")}}}];async function $(){const t=document.modelContext??navigator.modelContext??null;if(t)try{if(typeof t.registerTool=="function"){(await Promise.allSettled(u.map(n=>t.registerTool(n)))).forEach((n,a)=>{n.status==="rejected"&&console.debug(`WebMCP tool "${u[a].name}" not registered`,n.reason)});return}typeof t.provideContext=="function"&&await t.provideContext({tools:u})}catch(e){console.debug("WebMCP tool registration skipped",e)}}$();</script>  </body></html> <script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    // FAQ accordion functionality
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-item]').forEach(function(item) {
      const question = item.querySelector('.faq__question');
      const answer = item.querySelector('.faq__answer');
      const toggle = item.querySelector('.faq-toggle');
      
      function setAnswerState(answerEl, isOpen) {
        if (!answerEl) return;
        if (isOpen) {
          answerEl.classList.add('open');
          answerEl.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
        } else {
          answerEl.classList.remove('open');
          answerEl.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
        }
      }
      
      function toggleFaq() {
        const isOpen = answer && answer.classList.contains('open');
        
        // Close all answers
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq__answer').forEach(function(a) {
          setAnswerState(a, false);
        });
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle').forEach(function(t) { t.textContent = '+'; });
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq__question').forEach(function(q) {
          q.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        });
        
        // Toggle clicked item
        if (!isOpen && answer) {
          setAnswerState(answer, true);
          if (question) {
            question.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
          }
          if (toggle) toggle.textContent = '−';
        }
      }
      
      if (question) {
        setAnswerState(answer, false);
        question.addEventListener('click', toggleFaq);
        question.addEventListener('keydown', function(event) {
          if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') {
            event.preventDefault();
            toggleFaq();
          }
        });
      }
    });
    
    // Wireline Polygon Network - Subtle connected nodes
    (function() {
      var canvas = document.getElementById('particle-canvas');
      if (!canvas) return;
      
      var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      var nodes = [];
      var mouseX = -1000;
      var mouseY = -1000;
      var heroSection = document.getElementById('hero-section');
      var NODE_COUNT = 50;
      var CONNECTION_DIST = 150;
      var MOUSE_RADIUS = 200;
      
      function resize() {
        canvas.width = heroSection.offsetWidth;
        canvas.height = heroSection.offsetHeight;
        initNodes();
      }
      
      function createNode() {
        return {
          x: Math.random() * canvas.width,
          y: Math.random() * canvas.height,
          baseX: 0,
          baseY: 0,
          vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3,
          vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3,
          radius: 2 + Math.random() * 2
        };
      }
      
      function initNodes() {
        nodes = [];
        for (var i = 0; i < NODE_COUNT; i++) {
          var node = createNode();
          node.baseX = node.x;
          node.baseY = node.y;
          nodes.push(node);
        }
      }
      
      function updateNode(node) {
        // Gentle floating motion
        node.x += node.vx;
        node.y += node.vy;
        
        // Bounce off edges softly
        if (node.x < 0 || node.x > canvas.width) node.vx *= -1;
        if (node.y < 0 || node.y > canvas.height) node.vy *= -1;
        
        // Keep in bounds
        node.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(canvas.width, node.x));
        node.y = Math.max(0, Math.min(canvas.height, node.y));
        
        // Mouse interaction - nodes gently move away
        var dx = node.x - mouseX;
        var dy = node.y - mouseY;
        var dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
        
        if (dist < MOUSE_RADIUS && dist > 0) {
          var force = (MOUSE_RADIUS - dist) / MOUSE_RADIUS * 0.02;
          node.x += dx * force;
          node.y += dy * force;
        }
      }
      
      function draw() {
        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
        
        // Draw connections between nearby nodes
        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15)';
        ctx.lineWidth = 1;
        
        for (var i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
          for (var j = i + 1; j < nodes.length; j++) {
            var dx = nodes[i].x - nodes[j].x;
            var dy = nodes[i].y - nodes[j].y;
            var dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);
            
            if (dist < CONNECTION_DIST) {
              var opacity = (1 - dist / CONNECTION_DIST) * 0.2;
              ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(99, 102, 241, ' + opacity + ')';
              ctx.beginPath();
              ctx.moveTo(nodes[i].x, nodes[i].y);
              ctx.lineTo(nodes[j].x, nodes[j].y);
              ctx.stroke();
            }
          }
        }
        
        // Draw nodes
        for (var i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
          var node = nodes[i];
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.arc(node.x, node.y, node.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3)';
          ctx.fill();
        }
      }
      
      function animate() {
        for (var i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
          updateNode(nodes[i]);
        }
        draw();
        requestAnimationFrame(animate);
      }
      
      // Track mouse position
      heroSection.addEventListener('mousemove', function(e) {
        var rect = heroSection.getBoundingClientRect();
        mouseX = e.clientX - rect.left;
        mouseY = e.clientY - rect.top;
      });
      
      heroSection.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() {
        mouseX = -1000;
        mouseY = -1000;
      });
      
      window.addEventListener('resize', resize);
      
      resize();
      animate();
    })();
  });
</script>  <script type="module">document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",()=>{const o=document.querySelectorAll(".pricing-toggle-btn"),r=document.querySelectorAll(".pricing-amount[data-monthly]"),c=document.querySelectorAll(".pricing-amount-per[data-monthly]"),s=document.querySelectorAll(".pricing-save-badge"),d=document.querySelectorAll(".pricing-card .button-primary[data-monthly-href]");o.forEach(n=>{n.addEventListener("click",()=>{const e=n.dataset.period;o.forEach(t=>{const a=t.dataset.period===e;t.classList.toggle("active",a),t.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(a))}),r.forEach(t=>{t.textContent=t.dataset[e]}),c.forEach(t=>{t.textContent=t.dataset[e]}),s.forEach(t=>{t.classList.toggle("hidden",e==="monthly")}),d.forEach(t=>{t.href=t.dataset[e+"Href"]})})})});</script>